      "message": "test(app): run the debug HSM suites at a 40% adaptive load\n\nThe four debug suites whole_model_pocket, pocket_overhead,\nclimb_direction and adaptive_pinch spent their time in HSM plans at\nthe default optimal load (about 130 s for one 2D Adaptive plan in\ndebug). They now run the plans at 0.4 of D. The fixtures, the\nasserts and the laws do not change. A mutation check of each law\nfails each changed test. The default-load disc law of\nwhole_model_pocket stays in a new release-lane twin.\n\nFixes #1716\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
